WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:05.740
Harry Huxford wants to know if we can hit
5 cups off the table in a row.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.080
Sure we can!

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.080
So that was fairly easy

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:24.579
Now, let's take it a step further and try
10 cups

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.480
With Miikka and Emil

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:00.560
DanieLinZX challenges us to do 10 backhand
around the net shots in

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.360
a row.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.940
Let the Sensei show how it's done.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.200
So, Geeta Gupta wants us to put an apple

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.299
on one of our heads and shoot it down

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.760
with a ping pong ball.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.560
Let's decide who gets to be 
the target!

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:03.360
YES!!!

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:38.440
WhyBotherTry wants us to play a rally of 20

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.500
While upside down.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.360
Let's hope this doesn't take too long!

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:51.780
Thanks for watching guys

00:03:52.109 --> 00:03:54.360
If you enjoyed it, remember to give it a thumbs
up!

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.440
Until next time!

